<title>SWITZERLAND: Sulzer Medica shares indicated 300/350 Sfr.</title>
<headline>Sulzer Medica shares indicated 300/350 Sfr.</headline>
<dateline>WINTERTHUR, Switzerland 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sulzer AG said the issue price for shares in its Sulzer Medica unit being spun off had been indicated at 300 to 350 Swiss francs per registered share.</p>
<p>&quot;This implies a total market value of 3 billion to 3.5 billion Swiss francs ($2.086 billion to $2.4 billion), assuming full exercise of the over-allotment option,&quot; it said in a statement.  </p>
<p>Sulzer shares closed yesterday at 1,313 francs, up 11.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
